    - target: {fileID: 1268991185572159789, guid: 5d32e485e1d55874fb4ee6e52e6dfe28, type: 3}
      propertyPath: managedReferences[1001]._dialogueText
      value: 'The <i>Strange Derelect</i> of Old Town.


        Somehow, I always
        knew my search would lead me here.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1268991185572159789, guid: 5d32e485e1d55874fb4ee6e52e6dfe28, type: 3}
      propertyPath: managedReferences[1002]._dialogueText
      value: 'Architecture that defies the very world it stands upon.


        Reeking
        of foul candles, foreboding and ...'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1268991185572159789, guid: 5d32e485e1d55874fb4ee6e52e6dfe28, type: 3}
      propertyPath: managedReferences[1003]._dialogueText
      value: regret...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1268991185572159789, guid: 5d32e485e1d55874fb4ee6e52e6dfe28, type: 3}
      propertyPath: managedReferences[1004]._dialogueText
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1268991185572159789, guid: 5d32e485e1d55874fb4ee6e52e6dfe28, type: 3}
      propertyPath: managedReferences[1006]._dialogueText
      value: I really hate this place.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1268991185572159789, guid: 5d32e485e1d55874fb4ee6e52e6dfe28, type: 3}
      propertyPath: managedReferences[1007]._dialogueText
      value: 'Well, no talking myself out of this one.


        Time to do what
        must be done.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1268991185572159789, guid: 5d32e485e1d55874fb4ee6e52e6dfe28, type: 3}
      propertyPath: managedReferences[1008]._dialogueText
      value: Time to offer a rude hello and recover those stolen relics.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1268991185572159789, guid: 5d32e485e1d55874fb4ee6e52e6dfe28, type: 3}
      propertyPath: managedReferences[1009]._dialogueText
      value: Gathering so many powerful relics in one place cannot be good.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1268991185572159789, guid: 5d32e485e1d55874fb4ee6e52e6dfe28, type: 3}
      propertyPath: managedReferences[1010]._dialogueText
      value: What are they planning?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
